      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "The 7-card hand has 3 lands with both colors needed for its spells, a 1-drop, a 3-drop, and two 4-drops - a functional curve. While it lacks green sources, none of the cards in hand require green. Mulliganing to 6 loses a card for no strong reason.",
      "action_taken": "Chose to mulligan a keepable 7-card hand",
      "better_line": "Keep the 7-card hand. It has adequate mana (3 lands, 2 colors matching all spells in hand), a good curve (turns 1/3/4), and can draw into green sources naturally.",
      "type": "blunder",
