      "better_line": "Double-block Ghalta with Mausoleum Turnkey and Nightshade Stinger to reduce trample damage to 5, taking 8 total (19 → 11 life). At 11 life, Kimi25 could survive another turn and potentially deploy Undersea Invader (5/6 flash) as a blocker.",
